        "original_id": "9c54f073-d528-507f-92f0-40ea31090e0f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Homer Simpson, Principal Skinner, Selma, Patty, Hans Moleman, Harry Shearer, Matt Groening, Dan Castellaneta\n- Works: \"Principal Charming\", \"The Simpsons\", \"The Devil Wears Nada\"\n- Roles: Principal W. Seymour Skinner\n\nFacts:\n- In \"Principal Charming\", Homer Simpson invites Principal Skinner to dinner.\n- In \"Principal Charming\", Principal Skinner falls for Patty instead of her twin sister Selma.\n- Principal W. Seymour Skinner, born Armin Tamzarian, is a fictional character in the American animated sitcom \"The Simpsons\".\n- Harry Shearer voices Principal Skinner in \"The Simpsons\".\n- Hans Moleman was created by Matt Groening.\n- Hans Moleman is voiced by Dan Castellaneta.\n- Hans Moleman first appeared in the episode \"Principal Charming\".\n- \"The Devil Wears Nada\" is the fifth episode of the twenty-first season of \"The Simpsons\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
